## Development Workflow Rules

### Branch Strategy
- **main**: Production-ready, always deployable
- **release/\<v\>**: Active release branch managed by `ps-release-workflow` (`.release.json`)
- **feat/**, **fix/**, **docs/**, **hotfix/**: Short-lived focused branches

### Commit Policy
- Keep subjects short, no newlines or special chars
- Example: `feat: add player movement prediction`
- Use conventional commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `refactor:`, `test:`
- Always create new commits (never amend published/shared history)

### PR Requirements
- **Required**: Pass Gate 1 (`./scripts/precheck.sh`) and CI checks
- **Required**: Squash merge only for clean linear history

### Code Quality
- **Rust (`server-rs/`)**: `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo test`
- **TypeScript (`contracts/`, `client/react-client/`)**: strict mode, no unjustified `any`, Prettier + ESLint clean
- **Godot C# (`game-client/`)**: `./scripts/godot-verify.sh` and headless `/Users/pasitnusso/.local/bin/godot-bg`
- **Content & scripts**: `node scripts/check_content.mjs`, `node --test scripts/tests/*.test.mjs`

### Performance Standards
- Tick time: ≤7ms p50, ≤20ms p95
- Physics step: ≤5ms p50
- Deterministic simulation driven by `SimClock` (`server-rs/src/core/clock.rs`), not wall-clock time

### Testing Requirements
- Fast mid-iteration loop: `./scripts/fastcheck.sh`
- Full pre-ship verification: `./scripts/precheck.sh --no-install`
- Unit and integration tests across `server-rs/tests/`, `contracts/`, `scripts/tests/`, and `atelier/*/tests/`

### Documentation & Plan Management
- Specs and design docs live in `docs/superpowers/specs/` and `.claude/refined_backlog/<F-NNN>/spec.md`
- Implementation plans live in `docs/superpowers/plans/` and `.claude/refined_backlog/<F-NNN>/plan.md`
- Backlog items route through `.claude/idea_backlog/` and `.claude/refined_backlog/` (`ps-release-workflow`)
- Keep authoritative specs current (`docs/README.md`, `docs/unit-contract.md`, `docs/asset-delivery-spec.md`, `docs/event-flow.spec.md`, `docs/game-server.spec.md`)
- Document breaking changes and update tests alongside behavior changes
